DESCRIPTION:Would like a referral to an ENT. Oliver has failed 2 hearing ex
 ams at the school one in May 2025 and another in August 2025. He also faile
 d a speech screening in August of 2025. Also ask about allergy testing due 
 to possible tomato allergy reactions including throwing up and hives all ov
 er the body.\nAsk about watery stool on a regular basis and him only wantin
 g to bring juice or milk. Water is almost impossible to get him to drink if
  he can't get juice or milk he will cry and just go to sleep instead of dri
 nking water.
