DESCRIPTION:Event: fb://event/1246202609364437\n\n7C’s Winery will hold its
  Annual Mead Fest on Sept 16th from noon to 5 pm.\n\nCluckin' Pig BBQ food 
 truck will be on site.  https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=10009234891
 7787\n\nEnjoy the music by Rowan's Crossing https://www.facebook.com/Rowans
 CrossingMusic/\n\nIron Alliance will be doing demonstrations.  https://www.
 facebook.com/profile.php?id=100091745344629\n\nHappy to have Raven Wings Gy
 psy back this year.  https://www.facebook.com/RavenWingGypsies\n\nBird of P
 rey Demo from Dickerson Park Zoo https://www.facebook.com/DPZoo/  at 4 pm \
 n\nPeriod vendors and performers welcome\n\nBring the family and enjoy the 
 fun.\n\nThere is no charge to attend the event .\n\nFree wine and mead tast
 ing  \n\nSouvenir Mead tasting glasses are $5.00. \n\n7C’s will have cold b
 ottles of wine and mead as well as a few select beers available.\n\nFor mor
 e info or directions call 417-788-2263 or check our website www.7cswinery.c
 om/events or www.facebook.com/7cswinery\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230825T175954Z
